sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Product Agent user
  participant P as PAR owner
  participant M as ParMastra / direct Agent
  participant G as Gateway / Conexus owners
  U->>P: request
  P->>P: admit exact Release + RuntimeAgentProjection
  P->>M: bounded run + scoped Memory + RequestContext
  M->>G: typed tool request
  G-->>P: owner fact / receipt
  P-->>U: terminal Product truth

